==J37==
The J37 uses a [[Die casting|die-cast]] aluminum block with aluminum [[cylinder liner]]s. Primarily due to the cylinder liners being made from aluminum instead of cast-iron the engine weighs less than the J35Z engines. The intake manifold is made from a cast magnesium alloy.

